  "notes": "Original native GPU implementation of the version 5.2 visual design and its twenty controls. Continuous WASAPI PCM supplies 200 FFT amplitude samples at 50 Hz spacing and mean-square power; its calibration is not identical to undocumented SignalRGB audio bytes. Frequency sectors, decay, beat-color transitions and per-frame fading use native bounded scalar state. Layout Helper pauses on a new keypress or preview click. No browser or copied Canvas source is distributed. GPU antialiasing and seeded random hue selection can differ from the reference.",
